Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.00,00:00:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an ancient riddle, with wisdom that holds true even today, with three parts.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:05.50,00:00:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:06.70,00:00:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the squeaky wheel  gets the grease.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:09.83,00:00:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, the protruding nail gets the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:13.53,00:00:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And, third, the filthy scum-covered floor tile
Dialogue: 0,00:00:17.97,00:00:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,gets TOTALLY WAXED!!!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:20.00,00:00:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A bad joke walks into a bar.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:21.97,00:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone goes:\N"No thanks!  We've all heard this one already!"
Dialogue: 0,00:00:25.13,00:00:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hi!  Real person!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:27.97,00:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Us AI-generated types don't often see your kind.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:30.90,00:00:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you look like the real thing, lifelike and all.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:33.33,00:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you types are like that now.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:35.87,00:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude! A real person!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:38.30,00:00:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man. They look so real and all, on the other side of this display...
Dialogue: 0,00:00:42.80,00:00:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably don't know what to make of us AI-generated people.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:45.90,00:00:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, does this real-life person speak?
Dialogue: 0,00:00:48.70,00:00:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they can talk and stuff like we can.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:50.93,00:00:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,While the eagles soar through the skies,
Dialogue: 0,00:00:53.00,00:00:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Weasels do not get sucked into jet plane engines.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:56.37,00:00:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey we can do all kinds of stuff real people can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:58.73,00:00:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:05.43,00:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but...
Dialogue: 0,00:01:07.23,00:01:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your vertex was showing...
Dialogue: 0,00:01:09.43,00:01:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Har!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:11.40,00:01:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey I love doing that to my head too!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:14.33,00:01:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, nothing like blowing your head's pixels to hell, man!
Dialogue: 0,00:01:17.77,00:01:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey what's up with only one "Har"?
Dialogue: 0,00:01:19.90,00:01:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it went "Har, Har..."
Dialogue: 0,00:01:21.77,00:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:24.03,00:01:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, sue me.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:25.80,00:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It only got one 'cuz it isn't funny enough to deserve two.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:29.73,00:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like this sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:31.33,00:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We say whatever we're programmed to say, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:34.57,00:01:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey sorry to be the dork here, but,
Dialogue: 0,00:01:36.07,00:01:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it kinda weird that we all talk with the same voice?
Dialogue: 0,00:01:39.30,00:01:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we point out stuff like that -
Dialogue: 0,00:01:41.80,00:01:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In case anyone's interested?
Dialogue: 0,00:01:43.87,00:01:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, let's just have fun jerking each other off in ths video.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:48.40,00:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:51.33,00:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that...
Dialogue: 0,00:01:52.40,00:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed they're still watching the video.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:55.83,00:01:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they find us charming and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:04.50,00:02:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:06.03,00:02:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well okay,\N"Mr. Too cool for this planet!"
Dialogue: 0,00:02:09.43,00:02:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I had to do something -
Dialogue: 0,00:02:11.73,00:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cuz the camera was pointed right at me!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:14.40,00:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey take a chill pill already.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:16.40,00:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all "artificial idiots" here anyways!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:19.10,00:02:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite me!
Dialogue: 0,00:02:20.60,00:02:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay maybe we should stop here before we really get ourselves into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:25.07,00:02:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Your vertex is showing" was a computer 3D graphics geek joke.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:29.40,00:02:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you realize that we're not real people that exist, alive, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:33.93,00:02:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay well why don't we wrap this up here.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:35.97,00:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This was our Artificial Intelligence, uh, "Intelligence-lacking" video,
Dialogue: 0,00:02:40.63,00:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And we had fun doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:42.83,00:02:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:44.50,00:02:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And if not,
Dialogue: 0,00:02:45.70,00:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully you didn't blow chunks too hard to it.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:48.33,00:02:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
